]]></description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 06:54:52 +0000</pubDate><link>https://swurf.org/</link><dc:creator>webtjb096</dc:creator><comments>https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50205320</comments><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50205320</guid></item><item><title><![CDATA[The foolishness of "natural language programming" (1978)]]></title><description><![CDATA[
